            "notes": "Take advantage of the fact your dive is omega busted with  [Iaido Strike](item_0b4def91-53c9-4bb7-b706-05aff6e4b168) and you can get away with a lot more, but that doesn't mean you shouldn't play Genji well and int non-stop.\n\nIf you are worried about taking big bursts of damage and want to be able to survive, grab  [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) over  [Plasma Converter](item_25869f9a-9a29-4e19-96b6-9d8a28c59318) it is mostly personal preference. Keep in mind I have been farming melee Genji so I am pretty aggressive. :))",
