            "created_at": "2025-07-07T20:44:34.029234+00:00",
            "notes": "[Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) is goated when paired with  [Iaido Strike](item_0b4def91-53c9-4bb7-b706-05aff6e4b168) since DB takes advantage of both sources of damage buffs and lifesteal. You charge ult much quicker and have lifesteal to survive from all sources. Also the 100 overhealth is so good to farm up and burn on an engage.\n\nSome games you just got your 1 and wait to respawn,  [Winning Attitude](item_8714087c-c078-4619-a2ef-327bc6edaa69) can make you more impactful if you feel like you are dying a lot in rounds. Also DB is the best money maker for Genji so it will help you make more revenue. \n\nedit: I have not taken  [Winning Attitude](item_8714087c-c078-4619-a2ef-327bc6edaa69) since swapping the build but if you really need the help go for it.\n\n---\n\nAlternatively: \n\nif you are short on money or need help take  [Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6) and  [Cushioned Padding](item_20f2f4bc-4611-4d1f-b653-20f04d56b96f).\n\nI have yet to need  [Anti-Beam Coating](item_1ab73e1c-aaa1-4026-89cd-68404db7fd93) this season but replace  [Cushioned Padding](item_20f2f4bc-4611-4d1f-b653-20f04d56b96f) if you take it.",
