            "created_at": "2025-07-07T20:44:34.029234+00:00",
            "notes": "In this round we'll take  [Laceration](item_ee831ad3-3921-4aca-a761-c6b93cc7e7fe) since the buff makes it scary when we scale AP. \n\nWe'll buy  [Catalytic Crystal](item_3e3f4f77-cdf8-4dda-a5b0-2fb9390aefc4) since  [Laceration](item_ee831ad3-3921-4aca-a761-c6b93cc7e7fe) deals damage over time (DOT) and your buffed DB will make you charge ult so fast when these three tools combine!\n\nedit: I don't use [Clean Sweep](item_55e022d5-16b6-40e3-b428-e43bfbacb41d) anymore since it is just worse  [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) if you are rolling in it currently, take a peek at round 4 buys and get that.\n\n---\n\nIf you're against a  [Kiriko](hero_70a0ac5c-2a55-4fab-beeb-2f570886426f) Suzu makes [Laceration](item_ee831ad3-3921-4aca-a761-c6b93cc7e7fe) less impactful, but it is still usable since you can bait a suzu with the dash and deal the true damage with  [Iaido Strike](item_0b4def91-53c9-4bb7-b706-05aff6e4b168) or  [Spirit of Sojiro](item_273ac0b7-f669-4641-bd77-2826aadd3218) instead.",
