            "created_at": "2025-07-07T20:44:34.029234+00:00",
            "notes": "We want  [Superflexor](item_580b77b4-0d63-469b-99a8-5372c55dfc1b) since this perk sets us up for round 5, is far cheaper than  [Champion's Kit](item_8682f8c7-8811-439b-8d50-fa81cd43ddce), and gives 25% AP when max stacked. You'll want to adjust the play style slightly to farm a few stacks of this (2 clicks before engage) in order to deal the max damage. \n\nDB will benefit from +10 WP, +25 AP, but also the swing counts as a WP attack for  [Superflexor](item_580b77b4-0d63-469b-99a8-5372c55dfc1b) so it keeps the stack going so get your stacks before the fight and steamroll the enemies!\n\nalternative:\n\n[Champion's Kit](item_8682f8c7-8811-439b-8d50-fa81cd43ddce): the highest raw AP in for bigger dash and DB mult but far more spendy and you miss out on the 10 WP that is given from  [Superflexor](item_580b77b4-0d63-469b-99a8-5372c55dfc1b).\n\n---\n\nIf you're brokie grab  [Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6) instead with something another rare optional and make some money.",
