            "notes": "Here are the Power options for round 5:\n\nThe Power [Wyrm\u2019s Maw](item_5d8c3488-13a9-432a-987e-275522f68cc4) pairs perfectly with  [Superflexor](item_580b77b4-0d63-469b-99a8-5372c55dfc1b) you just need to be more accurate on who you're attacking before you engage since you're giving them stacks of extra damage received from SS.\n\nAlternative:\n [Hanamura Healing](item_d210417d-1e30-4571-a4f3-cccd1dfc23ca) pairs really well with both  [Laceration](item_ee831ad3-3921-4aca-a761-c6b93cc7e7fe) and our general build! The overhealth gained from SS + crits that you'll farm when stacking  [Superflexor](item_580b77b4-0d63-469b-99a8-5372c55dfc1b) benefit from this Power, however, I think you will struggle to confirm some elims that you would get with  [Wyrm\u2019s Maw](item_5d8c3488-13a9-432a-987e-275522f68cc4).\n\n---\n\nWe sell  [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) since only +10 AP/WP has resulted in the build falling off in late game scaling.\n\nReplace it with  [Lumerico Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8) since it has higher AP and gives you the armor regeneration. Pairing it with [Shady Spectacles](item_ef9bb72f-a56c-4fb6-a552-5abce0b943d7) will replace the 15% AP lifesteal.\n\nIf you're rolling in it  [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b) is an amazing pickup, however, even though it can be devastating this early on I typically wait to buy this perk on round 6.\n\n---\n\n [Transference Delta](item_4bcdd047-90a2-43af-8d57-160cb21022ee) can be a buy here as it has great synergy with both the general goal of the build (farm DB) and  [Lumerico Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8) but you're giving up a lot of AP so keep that in mind!\n\n [Ironclad Exhaust Ports](item_2d085fa5-ace6-4fab-9323-b7a06268bcd0) can be a cheaper option that is purely for more tanking when diving, these options are purely for if you dislike removing  [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) and want to keep some self sustain tools.",
