            "round_number": 6,
            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-07-07T20:44:34.029234+00:00",
            "notes": "By round 6 you should have enough money to buy both  [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b) and  [Champion's Kit](item_8682f8c7-8811-439b-8d50-fa81cd43ddce), but if you can't buy both prioritize  [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b) at all costs.  [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b)  makes your shuriken will be more threatening, DB scales more due to the higher WP/AP split, and you gain that 10% damage boost when a target is  30% hp.\n\nOf course we want to prioritize [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b) and  [Champion's Kit](item_8682f8c7-8811-439b-8d50-fa81cd43ddce) since they offer the highest raw stats to scale DB \n\n---\n\n**Do not ever sell:**  [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b) or  [Superflexor](item_580b77b4-0d63-469b-99a8-5372c55dfc1b)  \n\nDon't mix too many of these together, I only recommend following one of these routes if you with to stray off the suggested path, but here are some alternative buys you can take:\n\nWhile it is super good, we don't entirely need  [Catalytic Crystal](item_3e3f4f77-cdf8-4dda-a5b0-2fb9390aefc4) anymore so you could replace it with  [Iridescent Iris](item_b7fb28ef-ce82-416b-8693-01c274f8df4e) since it is an upgrade in terms of raw AP.\n\nIf they are not dying fast enough, usually happens against moira and mercy, take  [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505).  [Ashe](hero_37b42a2d-a82d-4a22-9df2-4c812c873b54), [Moira](hero_7fb6ff1e-a193-40c0-bd0a-25c1928fbaed), or  [Stinger](item_e9d0d530-d620-4e74-a34d-38cdebfeb9a4)  [Juno](hero_035c63b7-084c-4abd-9de5-c9a00e9b6a18) should take  [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505), but if no one has it you might need to pick it up.\n\nIf you think you're not having enough DBs, you may not be playing optimally since you should be able to farm 2-5 depending on the match length, but you can take  [Transference Delta](item_4bcdd047-90a2-43af-8d57-160cb21022ee) but you **must** keep  [Lumerico Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8) if you plan to do this.\n\nIf you don't have a lot of money round 6,  [Shady Spectacles](item_ef9bb72f-a56c-4fb6-a552-5abce0b943d7), [Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6), and  [Ironclad Exhaust Ports](item_2d085fa5-ace6-4fab-9323-b7a06268bcd0) are great budget options and can be clutch to help keep you in the game.",
