            "created_at": "2025-07-07T20:44:34.029234+00:00",
            "notes": "For Power it really depends on what you want:\n\n[Hanamura Healing](item_d210417d-1e30-4571-a4f3-cccd1dfc23ca) is the default due to the randomness of online lobbies and it's got great reliability that will work in just about every situation. It also is the replacement for most of your sustainability that we sold as the rounds progressed.\n\n[Dragon's Breath](item_32dc8374-7541-46fb-9891-29b7fbe9ed4d) is the more fun and aggressive option since if you swing on someone point blank, you will hit them with both the swing and projectile for even more damage and ult charge.\n\n---\n\nWhen it comes to perks, you need  [Champion's Kit](item_8682f8c7-8811-439b-8d50-fa81cd43ddce) if you skipped it due to money constraints last round. \n\nI also picked up  [Iridescent Iris](item_b7fb28ef-ce82-416b-8693-01c274f8df4e) since it makes DB more comfortable to use in more situations since more DB usage = charging more DB afterwards.\n\n[Enduring Edge](item_6a68babb-9434-42a0-8374-5b5973e8b6db)  is also a nice pickup since it a lot of targets will be either too tanky that you can't eliminate them all in a single normal usage or they have some sort of shove/movement that wastes the DB timer.\n\nYeah  [Transference Delta](item_4bcdd047-90a2-43af-8d57-160cb21022ee) is still fine but it **must** be paired with  [Lumerico Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8).",
